# Standard profile: Down keeps the screen column. Right x3 on `a<TAB>b`
# puts the caret after `b` at cell 5 (tab width 4); Down lands under it,
# so X goes in after the 5: `12345X67890`, as in VS Code.
write f.txt "a\tb\n1234567890\n"
open f.txt
key right
key right
key right
key down
type "X"
command file.save
expect file f.txt contains "12345X67890\n"
